@startuml Component Diagram - Interfaces
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype polyline

title Employee Absence Request System - Component Interfaces

' ==================== COMPONENTS ====================

[Manager CLI] as CLI #LightBlue
[Employee Web Controller] as WebCtrl #LightBlue
[Absence Service] as SVC #LightGreen
[XML Employee Repository] as XMLRepo #LightPink
[JSON Manager Repository] as JSONRepo #LightPink

' ==================== INTERFACES ====================

interface "IAbsenceService" as IAbsSvc
interface "IEmployeeRepository" as IEmpRepo
interface "IManagerRepository" as IMgrRepo

' Service provides IAbsenceService
SVC -up- IAbsSvc

' Repositories provide their interfaces
XMLRepo -up- IEmpRepo
JSONRepo -up- IMgrRepo

' ==================== REQUIRED INTERFACES ====================

' CLI requires IAbsenceService
CLI --> IAbsSvc : uses

' WebCtrl requires IAbsenceService
WebCtrl --> IAbsSvc : uses

' Service requires Repositories
SVC --> IEmpRepo : uses
SVC --> IMgrRepo : uses

' ==================== INTERFACE DETAILS ====================

note top of IAbsSvc
  <b>Provided by:</b> AbsenceServiceImpl
  <b>Required by:</b> CLI, WebController

  <b>Operations:</b>
  + getEmployee(id): EmployeeDTO
  + submitRequest(...): AbsenceRequestDTO
  + processRequest(mgr, req, approved): AbsenceRequestDTO
  + getPendingRequests(): List<AbsenceRequestDTO>
  + cancelRequest(emp, req): boolean
  + validateManager(id): boolean
end note

note right of IEmpRepo
  <b>Provided by:</b> XmlEmployeeRepository
  <b>Required by:</b> AbsenceServiceImpl

  <b>Operations:</b>
  + findById(id): Optional<Employee>
  + findAll(): List<Employee>
  + save(employee): Employee
  + findAbsenceRequestById(id): Optional<AbsenceRequest>
  + updateAbsenceRequest(req): boolean
end note

note right of IMgrRepo
  <b>Provided by:</b> JsonManagerRepository
  <b>Required by:</b> AbsenceServiceImpl

  <b>Operations:</b>
  + findById(id): Optional<Manager>
  + findAll(): List<Manager>
  + save(manager): Manager
  + validateCredentials(id): boolean
end note

' ==================== LEGEND ====================
legend bottom
  |= Symbol |= Meaning |
  | --o | Provided Interface (Lollipop) |
  | --> | Required Interface (Dependency) |
  | Component provides interface that other components require |
endlegend

@enduml
